aff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:40658","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_vndb_c1039","characterName":"不知火 義一","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c1039"},"originalCharacterName":"不知火 義一","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"707"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"175"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"67"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The protagonist of the story. His power is an exact reflection of his personality. He’s always been one who is optimistic, and never gives up during difficult times. Usually, Yoshikazu fools around and perverted but when it comes time to be serious he is hot-headed and heroic."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Warum's review."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Originally didn't Yoshikazu have any interest in Mars. From a young age every part of his body except his Heart was healthy and he was hospitalized a long time because of his heart. Unlike Yoshikazu, every part of Chenfui's body except her heart was ill. After Chenfui's death he got her heart. When Chenfui's heart became a part of Yoshikazu he started to see her when he was unconscious and eventually named her Kokoro. Having no dreams of his own he decided to pursue Kokoro's."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c1039"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/58/586878c12d69cef09a4600a9a6b7f52be68b4cb9b0813cd68ddbe9a3b1024fa4.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3b/3be1b0acbde849c70592ead04a8edfe5cf7284bcd6b4e226a3121192cfc9e3ad.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"大石 恵三","creatorId":"vndb:s72","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s72","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s72","name":"近藤 隆","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:22214","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c1040","characterName":"一条 雫","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c1040"},"originalCharacterName":"一条 雫","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"1226"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"83"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"156"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"84"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"56"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"53"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"One of the main heroine. Been with Shiranui since the start, and remains the only partner of Shiranui. The bond between them is strong enough that they wouldn’t hesitate to sacrifice their own life for the other… yet they aren’t lovers. Her personality seems like that of a perfect, cool, analytical type, but with Shiranui, she is frank and quite violent. Her biggest weakness is Japan's culture. When she comes in contact with something like tatamis, or a kotatsu, she transforms into an hopeless human being."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her power is relatively unknown and thus rare, but can be described as the control of energy when she duel-wields her machete."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Warum's review."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c1040"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4a/4a5129526d5ef38275d3fd364e0a3a483d59315d450f5415ba7a1a5475295e05.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c7/c7c90562070b74cfd46e82d64443952a65606fda31d8258cc4c135b49480a37b.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"波奈束 風景","creatorId":"vndb:s44","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s44","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s44","name":"中島 沙樹","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:22211","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c1045","characterName":"鷹星 カズナ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c1045"},"originalCharacterName":"鷹星 カズナ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"929"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"92"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"164"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"89"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"60"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"54"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Another main heroine. Kazuna is the mayor of Forsyse and the caretaker of Yoshikazu and Shizuku. Served as the explanation person during the first half of the story. Her power is telekinesis…in a large scale. Her personality is quite light-hearted, and she is the one who names all the special moves for other people’s abilities."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Warum's review."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c1045"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d7/d728611ea3ed631f21dd0745038b3c5e39aa57e075e200f1ab3a9f19790c1616.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d3/d3261d80b65f1da496719e0fedeb14902bcfc115c9a5ddecf81fc4dcaa727c8b.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"閏 若葉","creatorId":"vndb:s777","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s777","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s777","name":"吉住 梢","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:22219","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c1047","characterName":"リーティア・フォン・エアハルト","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c1047"},"originalCharacterName":"リーティア・フォン・エアハルト","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"1127"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"70"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"150"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"68"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"58"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"43"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Last main heroine. Lidia is cute. Like a little sister to Shiranui and Shizuku, she can hold her own but chooses to rely on them. Her ability is the mech-inization of herself into a half jet unit and to summon a ninty-nine caliber pistol, coincidentally named Shiranui, which is the only thing that can penetrate a ‘factory’ wall. As such she is the military leader of Forsyse."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Warum's review."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c1047"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/77/77921fb29b8224e8bbd12ffde658df01666fbb5ccc4cce4cd1d412dee75a5101.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/54/54f31eb918d933231c43ab4f70e594e24c6279ef3788f143603d9df4fde46154.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"北都 南","creatorId":"vndb:s113","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s113","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s113","name":"ひと美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:22210","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c1048","characterName":"アクア・ダンチェッカー","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c1048"},"originalCharacterName":"アクア・ダンチェッカー","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"921"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"87"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"167"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"88"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"57"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"51"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Aqua is one of the more dominating supporting character. She is both the vice-president of intelligence club and the vice-president of the military club. That plus her constant involvement around Lidia makes her seem like a main heroine. Unfortunately, it is not so. Her ability is the coolest one in the game. Her katana can slice through time and space, allowing Aqua to essentially move at insane speeds and dodge anything coming her way. As well as instant teleport to slice through opponents make her the ideal swordsman."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Warum's review."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c1048"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/df/df14b5658d5cb599454c905518f73024d4088a3f8decb3a15f4fd07c21439d6f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4f/4f8dc536b8ac3204c2a4fd5b650403c965ad110725dfc467b7be44e2e1d281fa.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"一色 ヒカル","creatorId":"vndb:s6","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s6","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s6","name":"田中 涼子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:22207","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c1049","characterName":"ココロ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c1049"},"originalCharacterName":"ココロ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"108"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"67"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"148"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"70"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"45"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"38"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Shiranui talks with his inner-self, Kokoro when he’s unconscious. His heart, which is this mysterious girl, is the driving force for his unwavering will."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is actually"},{"spoiler":true,"text":"the used-to-be terminally ill little sister of Hoan Wenje/Phantom Killer; a Chinese girl by the name of 皇千慧 (Hoan Chenfui) who always wanted to travel to Mars, and -after proper legal procedures- whose heart was transplanted into Shiranui following her death. The real reason Shiranui always looked for a way of getting to Mars is her."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Meanwhile her older brother, Koe also decided to pursue her dreams, thus ended up in the Mars project himself too, and he's unaware for a good while that his good friend and colleague, Shiranui was the recipient of Chenfui's heart. Upon finding out the truth and after Tempest's persuasion he swore revenge against Shiranui as he blames him partially for her death."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Unfortunately there's no route for her even though she's a crucial key character with a lot of screentime."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Warum's review."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c1049"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e1/e10cc9f0c338ca6ef83016615ed2cbdcc48fba778dc3cc2847af8af5ddfb9078.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c0/c00c6a8b7d0a79a13eaf3a648978f71146265f49012375b77878bd6ab3cd3103.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"有栖川 みや美","creatorId":"vndb:s363","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s363","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s363","name":"高田 初美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:22215","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c1050","characterName":"レナート・エフィンジャー","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c1050"},"originalCharacterName":"レナート・エフィンジャー","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"1031"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"71"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"159"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"72"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"56"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"51"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Kazuna's secretary."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c10