91"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"89"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The figure Shizuku and Shiranui fought one hundred years ago, during the opening."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Formerly known as Dmitri Karanikov, the leader of the Russian section of the Mars Colonization project. Also father of Tsunami. He was brainwashed by Shannon into thinking that he needed to give humanity a trial of survival, like the rest of the people in Calamity Monkeys. He possesses the power to transform the earth into lava and control it. His body mostly consists of the lava, and it is through him that it is revealed that the four full-adult Calamity Monkeys still possess the emotions that existed before their manipulation, though those emotions only drive them to more intensely desire to test humanity with trials and tribulations. His love for his daughter, in particular, drives him to this."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c1061"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/75/75c7e0e9c021620fd785fa2931dae39c3f39145020e795d6e674dece5887292c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d7/d7678e1767651728c2d2aad21dfb8bd098865b1826b60e4cc6292dffb8318008.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"西狩 克己","creatorId":"vndb:s377","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s377","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s377","name":"安元 洋貴","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:22217","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c1062","characterName":"シャノン・ワードワーズ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c1062"},"originalCharacterName":"シャノン・ワードワーズ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Shannon is a man from the States who was a part of the Mars colonizing project."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"He is the main antagonist and the one who pulls the strings of the events happening in the story. Also the first one to discover the power of patches and the first one to climb the stairs of evolution."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c1062"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/11/11c0ff08c216efc695d3c0ae295c45a2bb638f2d6e2ba2c0439e62915f85b4b1.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/35/35aa1a0fcd25d0093cbbaa4c12ea782d8cbd1cf8bc84819247fc92fa9fa9213d.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c1063","characterName":"アースクェイク","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c1063"},"originalCharacterName":"アースクェイク","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"213"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"185"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"104"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":true,"text":"Formerly known as Tyron Bistwork, a American who was a part of the Mars colonizing project. He was a general expert in machines and AI. He was brainwashed by Shannon though his patch to believe that, for humanity's sake, he had to put them through trials and tribulations. His power allows him to cause a localized Magnitude 10 earthquake through the activation of the pile bunker on his right arm."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c1063"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cc/cc374fb3432a411c8d82a0211ba890caa4036406805eae0d08b6512f7f6f963f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/26/2640fd97f9cc65aaad144cc7f7663c0f985cffa8b8d0896eeefc5007f4443e57.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"子太 明","creatorId":"vndb:s384","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s384","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s384","name":"藤原 啓治","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:22218","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c1064","characterName":"ファントムキラー","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c1064"},"originalCharacterName":"ファントムキラー","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"530"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"179"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"69"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":true,"text":"The form that Kou took on after Shannon revealed that Shiranui's heart once belonged to his little sister Chenfui. Through Shannon's intervention, the balance between his hate and his friendship was tipped drastically in the direction of hate, creating an all-consuming desire to first kill Shiranui, then the rest of humanity. His power allows him to create and manipulate invisible blades capable of cutting through anything, literally. This includes energy such as telekinesis or heat."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"While he still retains a deep abiding love for his sister, that only strengthens his hate, turning his pre-existing case of mild misanthropy into an absolute hatred of all humans other than her."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c1064"}],"profileFacts":